# Grid table with multi-line cells

Cells may contain several paragraphs, lists, and code blocks. No hard breaks
here — this exercises multi-line cell content and blank lines within bands
(which still carry their boundary pipes).

+-----------------+-----------------+
| Column A        | Column B        |
+=================+=================+
| First paragraph | A list:         |
| in cell A.      |                 |
|                 | - item one      |
| Second          | - item two      |
| paragraph.      |                 |
+-----------------+-----------------+
| Code example:   | Text after.     |
|                 |                 |
| ```rust         |                 |
| fn main() {}    |                 |
| ```             |                 |
+-----------------+-----------------+
